\subtree{
  \title{Decision}
  \p{After the seal, the interface is a set of \code{opaque} constants with an inhabitation witness from the kernel. A self-hosted kernel (no Mathlib) is on the roadmap (\ref{ms-0007}). A build variant may replace the kernel by axioms for speed; the kernel-backed build remains the consistency witness and runs in CI.}
}
\subtree{
  \title{Rationale}
  \p{\code{opaque} is Lean's native "axiom without loss of consistency": the body is invisible to the elaborator and the kernel alike, so the theory literally cannot depend on it.}
}
\subtree{
